      "source": "Factory bean for creation of <a href=\"RepositoryComposition.RepositoryFragments.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryComposition.RepositoryFragments</code></a>. This <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/FactoryBean.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>FactoryBean</code></a> uses named\n<a href=\"#%3Cinit%3E(java.util.List)\"><code>bean references</code></a> to look up <a href=\"RepositoryFragment.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryFragment</code></a> beans and\nconstruct <a href=\"RepositoryComposition.RepositoryFragments.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>RepositoryComposition.RepositoryFragments</code></a>.",
